@startuml autonomous-product-capability-boundary
title Autonomous Product / Autonomous Capability Boundary ; per ADR-ES-017 §11

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Capability" as C
class "Autonomous Capability" as AC
class "Product" as P
class "Autonomous Product" as AP

C <|-- AC : specializes

C --> P : may enable
AC --> AP : possibly enables

P <|-- AP : specializes

note right
  Per ADR-ES-017 §11 + APROD-AUTO-NEG-003:
  - Autonomous Capability does NOT automatically make every Product it enables autonomous
  - Autonomous materiality must be demonstrated at the Product boundary
end note

@enduml
